msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "World Object Kind"
msgstr "世界对象种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An open value vocabulary for everyday kinds of represented world objects. Values classify objects within an attributed world description; they are neither Concept individuals nor per-kind object subclasses."
msgstr "用于所表示对象的日常种类的开放值词汇。各值在有归属的世界描述中分类对象；它们既非 Concept 个体，也非各对象种类的子类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectKind|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An open value vocabulary for everyday kinds of represented world objects. Values classify objects within an attributed world description; they are neither Concept individuals nor per-kind object subclasses."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：用于所表示对象的日常种类的开放值词汇。各值在有归属的世界描述中分类对象；它们既非 Concept 个体，也非各对象种类的子类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRecord|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "World Object Record"
msgstr "世界对象记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed provider record describing an entity or part in one simulated world. Object identity, provider program and world scope remain distinct; a provider handle alone is not a global identity."
msgstr "描述模拟世界中某实体或部件的有归属提供方记录。对象身份、提供程序及世界范围保持独立；单个提供方句柄不是全局身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRecord|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRecord|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An attributed provider record describing an entity or part in one simulated world. Object identity, provider program and world scope remain distinct; a provider handle alone is not a global identity."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：描述模拟世界中某实体或部件的有归属提供方记录。对象身份、提供程序及世界范围保持独立；单个提供方句柄不是全局身份。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectStateClaim|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "World Object State Claim"
msgstr "世界对象状态声明"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectStateClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed claim of an object's meaningful-state digest under a named canonical encoding profile. Causal replacement follows supersedes, not clocks; concurrent unsuperseded claims may coexist."
msgstr "在具名规范编码配置下对对象有意义状态摘要作出的有归属声明。因果替代依据 supersedes 而非时钟；并发且未被替代的声明可共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectStateClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectStateClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectStateClaim|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectStateClaim|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An attributed claim of an object's meaningful-state digest under a named canonical encoding profile. Causal replacement follows supersedes, not clocks; concurrent unsuperseded claims may coexist."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：在具名规范编码配置下对对象有意义状态摘要作出的有归属声明。因果替代依据 supersedes 而非时钟；并发且未被替代的声明可共存。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateView|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "World State View"
msgstr "世界状态视图"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateView|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicitly bounded inventory of state claims for one object, provider, world and encoding profile. Its current heads are exactly inventory members with no superseding member, never a certificate of global completeness."
msgstr "针对一个对象、提供方、世界及编码配置的显式有界状态声明清单。当前头节点恰为清单内没有替代者的成员，绝非全局完整性证书。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateView|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateView|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateView|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateView|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An explicitly bounded inventory of state claims for one object, provider, world and encoding profile. Its current heads are exactly inventory members with no superseding member, never a certificate of global completeness."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：针对一个对象、提供方、世界及编码配置的显式有界状态声明清单。当前头节点恰为清单内没有替代者的成员，绝非全局完整性证书。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRequest|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "World Object Request"
msgstr "世界对象请求"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRequest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An exact source revision requesting that an object be provided in a simulated world. It is distinct from an attention request, an agent's Desire and any act that acknowledges or fulfills it."
msgstr "请求在模拟世界中提供对象的确切来源修订。它区别于注意请求、代理的 Desire 以及任何确认或履行请求的行为。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRequest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRequest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRequest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldObjectRequest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An exact source revision requesting that an object be provided in a simulated world. It is distinct from an attention request, an agent's Desire and any act that acknowledges or fulfills it."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：请求在模拟世界中提供对象的确切来源修订。它区别于注意请求、代理的 Desire 以及任何确认或履行请求的行为。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestTransition|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Request Transition Record"
msgstr "请求转换记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestTransition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed record of a request-state transition for an exact request revision. It preserves source evidence and time without asserting an unrecorded act or replacing history with a mutable success flag."
msgstr "针对确切请求修订的有归属状态转换记录。它保留来源证据及时间，不声明未记录行为，也不以可变成功标志替代历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestTransition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestTransition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestTransition|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestTransition|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An attributed record of a request-state transition for an exact request revision. It preserves source evidence and time without asserting an unrecorded act or replacing history with a mutable success flag."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：针对确切请求修订的有归属状态转换记录。它保留来源证据及时间，不声明未记录行为，也不以可变成功标志替代历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestResponse|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Object Request Response Record"
msgstr "对象请求回复记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestResponse|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed reply record tied to the exact object-request revision it answers. Recording a response does not itself establish fulfillment or acceptance."
msgstr "绑定到所回答确切对象请求修订的有归属回复记录。记录回复本身不确立履行或接受。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestResponse|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestResponse|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestResponse|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestResponse|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An attributed reply record tied to the exact object-request revision it answers. Recording a response does not itself establish fulfillment or acceptance."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：绑定到所回答确切对象请求修订的有归属回复记录。记录回复本身不确立履行或接受。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestFulfillment|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Object Request Fulfillment Record"
msgstr "对象请求履行记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestFulfillment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An attributed report identifying the provided object, exact request revision, cited work and condition evaluations. Fulfillment and the agent's later acceptance are separate claims; validation does not execute criteria."
msgstr "标识所提供对象、确切请求修订、引用工作及条件评估的有归属报告。履行与代理后续接受是独立声明；验证不执行判据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestFulfillment|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestFulfillment|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestFulfillment|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestFulfillment|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An attributed report identifying the provided object, exact request revision, cited work and condition evaluations. Fulfillment and the agent's later acceptance are separate claims; validation does not execute criteria."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：标识所提供对象、确切请求修订、引用工作及条件评估的有归属报告。履行与代理后续接受是独立声明；验证不执行判据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrection|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Object Request Correction Record"
msgstr "对象请求纠正记录"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrection|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An evidence-backed correction of a recorded response or transition for one request revision. It retains the original record and source rather than erasing history or denying that a real event occurred."
msgstr "针对某请求修订中已记录回复或转换的有证据纠正。它保留原始记录及来源，不擦除历史，也不否认现实事件曾发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrection|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrection|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrection|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrection|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An evidence-backed correction of a recorded response or transition for one request revision. It retains the original record and source rather than erasing history or denying that a real event occurred."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：针对某请求修订中已记录回复或转换的有证据纠正。它保留原始记录及来源，不擦除历史，也不否认现实事件曾发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ObjectAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Object Acceptance"
msgstr "对象接受"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ObjectAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An agent's recorded acceptance act for an exact fulfillment and request revision. Agent, original acceptance words, source evidence and acceptance time are explicit; fulfillment alone does not imply acceptance."
msgstr "代理对确切履行及请求修订作出的已记录接受行为。代理、原始接受措辞、来源证据及接受时间均须明确；仅有履行不蕴含接受。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ObjectAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ObjectAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ObjectAcceptance|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ObjectAcceptance|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: An agent's recorded acceptance act for an exact fulfillment and request revision. Agent, original acceptance words, source evidence and acceptance time are explicit; fulfillment alone does not imply acceptance."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：代理对确切履行及请求修订作出的已记录接受行为。代理、原始接受措辞、来源证据及接受时间均须明确；仅有履行不蕴含接受。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CitedWorkEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Cited Work Evidence"
msgstr "所引工作证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CitedWorkEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A source artifact in the role of work cited as done. Its recorded reference kind and verification status remain source-attributed; citation alone is not execution, verification or satisfaction of a condition."
msgstr "作为已完成工作引用证据的来源制品角色。其引用种类及核验状态仍归属于来源；单凭引用不构成执行、核验或条件满足。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CitedWorkEvidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CitedWorkEvidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inferring execution, authority, acceptance or global completeness from a source record alone."
msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CitedWorkEvidence|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/CitedWorkEvidence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: A source artifact in the role of work cited as done. Its recorded reference kind and verification status remain source-attributed; citation alone is not execution, verification or satisfaction of a condition."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：作为已完成工作引用证据的来源制品角色。其引用种类及核验状态仍归属于来源；单凭引用不构成执行、核验或条件满足。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorkReferenceKind|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Work Reference Kind"
msgstr "工作引用种类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorkReferenceKind|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
