msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：按明确规范配置编码的有意义状态的带算法标记摘要。断言记录是 InformationObject；其自身字节区别于所选状态制品。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/providerHandle|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "provider handle"
msgstr "提供方句柄"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/providerHandle|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact opaque handle supplied by a provider for an object or part. Preserve it verbatim within explicit provider/world scope; identical handles in other scopes imply no identity."
msgstr "提供方为对象或部件给出的确切不透明句柄。在明确的提供方和世界范围内原样保留；其他范围中的相同句柄不隐含实体相同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/providerHandle|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

