msgstr "提供方能力代码"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/worldObjectCapability|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A capability offered for the object under its provider's original code, retained verbatim. A code is neither an access grant nor a proof of present usability."
msgstr "按提供方原始代码为对象提供的能力，原样保留。代码既非访问授权，也非当前可用性的证明。"

