msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/worldObjectCapability|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: A capability offered for the object under its provider's original code, retained verbatim. A code is neither an access grant nor a proof of present usability."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：按提供方原始代码为对象提供的能力，原样保留。代码既非访问授权，也非当前可用性的证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/firstSeenAt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
