msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/firstSeenAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: The original date-time at which the environment reports first seeing the object. It is not a global first or a supersession ordering key."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：环境报告首次见到对象的原始日期时间。它不是全局首次时间，也不是取代关系的排序键。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/semanticTypeAsRecorded|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
