msgstr "避免仅从来源记录推断执行、权威、接受或全局完备性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestRevisionDigest|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the provider, world, original source and recorded scope; preserve conflicting reports without defaults."
msgstr "保留提供方、世界、原始来源和所记录范围；保留冲突报告而不设默认值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestRevisionDigest|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this documented meaning: The algorithm-tagged digest of the exact request revision an offer, fulfillment or acceptance answers. It must agree with that revision's own contentDigest, not hash the response."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：提议、履行或接受所回应的确切请求修订的带算法标记摘要。它必须与该修订自身的 contentDigest 一致，而非对回应计算哈希。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestTransitionAt|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "recorded request transition time"
msgstr "所记录的请求转换时间"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestTransitionAt|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The original date-time reported for a request transition. It neither orders causal replacement nor proves an act occurred without source evidence."
msgstr "请求转换所报告的原始日期时间。它不对因果取代排序，也不在缺少来源证据时证明行为已发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestTransitionAt|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

