msgid "Retain this documented meaning: The original date-time reported for a request transition. It neither orders causal replacement nor proves an act occurred without source evidence."
msgstr "保留此有据可查的含义：请求转换所报告的原始日期时间。它不对因果取代排序，也不在缺少来源证据时证明行为已发生。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestState|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "request state"
msgstr "请求状态"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestState|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The explicitly recorded state of an object request or its transition claim. Missing state is unknown; differing reports retain separate attributed records."
msgstr "对象请求或其转换断言所明确记录的状态。缺失状态保持未知；不同报告保留各自独立归属的记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/requestState|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
