msgstr "所欲求的对象位置"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/preferredLocation|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The Location where a Desire's bearer would welcome the object, not a claim that it is actually there or a cast of the request into an intentional mode."
msgstr "Desire 承载者希望对象所处的 Location，不声称对象实际在那里，也不将请求记录转为意向模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/preferredLocation|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

