msgid "cites work evidence"
msgstr "引用工作证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citesWork|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact source work artifact cited as done. Citation is distinct from genealogical derivation and does not itself verify the work."
msgstr "被引用为已完成工作的确切来源制品。引用区别于谱系派生，且本身不核验工作。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/citesWork|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
