msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/recordsFulfillment|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an explicitly attributed environment record with exact source identities."
msgstr "用于具有确切来源身份和明确归属的环境记录。"

