msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:StateViewScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:WorldStateView ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:StateViewScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:WorldStateView ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "state view head definition"
msgstr "状态视图头部定义"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Current state claims are exactly the retained members with no superseding member in the same view. Every concurrent head is retained; clocks and serialization order choose no winner."
msgstr "当前状态断言恰为同一视图中未被任何成员取代的保留成员。保留每个并发头部；时钟与序列化顺序都不选择胜者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:currentStateClaim ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:StateViewHeadDefinitionLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:currentStateClaim ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestTagConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "meaningful state digest algorithm tag"
msgstr "有意义状态摘要算法标记"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestTagConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each supplied worldObjectState digest retains an explicit algorithm tag and nonempty payload. This lexical obligation neither hashes bytes nor verifies an algorithm, encoding or digest length."
msgstr "每个给出的 worldObjectState 摘要保留明确的算法标记和非空载荷。此词法义务不计算字节哈希，也不核验算法、编码或摘要长度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestTagConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestTagConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestTagConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/WorldStateDigestTagConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
