msgstr "每个给出的 requestRevisionDigest 摘要保留明确的算法标记和非空载荷。此词法义务不计算字节哈希，也不核验算法、编码或摘要长度。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestRevisionDigestTagConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

