msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestRevisionDigestTagConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:RequestRevisionDigestTagConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:requestRevisionDigest ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:RequestRevisionDigestTagConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:requestRevisionDigest ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "recorded response revision binding"
msgstr "所记录回应的修订绑定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The retained record answers the same exact request revision from which it is linked. A record cannot silently answer a different revision."
msgstr "保留记录回应与链接来源相同的确切请求修订。记录不能悄然回应另一个修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:recordsResponse ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:RecordedResponseRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:recordsResponse ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "recorded fulfillment revision binding"
msgstr "所记录履行的修订绑定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The retained record answers the same exact request revision from which it is linked. A record cannot silently answer a different revision."
msgstr "保留记录回应与链接来源相同的确切请求修订。记录不能悄然回应另一个修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:recordsFulfillment ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:RecordedFulfillmentRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:recordsFulfillment ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "request correction target presence"
msgstr "请求纠正目标存在性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A correction retains at least one original response or transition target, with its source evidence. A correction does not erase that target or rewrite an event."
msgstr "纠正保留至少一个原始回应或转换目标及其来源证据。纠正不删除目标或改写事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RequestCorrection ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:RequestCorrectionTargetConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RequestCorrection ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "request correction revision agreement"
msgstr "请求纠正修订一致性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A corrected response or transition answers the same request revision as the correction record. Unrelated request histories are not silently merged."
msgstr "被纠正的回应或转换回应与纠正记录相同的请求修订。不悄然合并无关请求历史。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RequestCorrection ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:RequestCorrectionRevisionConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RequestCorrection ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fulfillment condition membership"
msgstr "履行条件归属"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every condition claimed met by a fulfillment is stated on its exact answered request revision. A different request's criteria cannot stand in for that revision."
msgstr "履行声称满足的每个条件均在其回应的确切请求修订中陈述。另一请求的标准不能替代该修订。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:meetsCondition ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:FulfillmentConditionMembershipConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:meetsCondition ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fulfillment condition coverage"
msgstr "履行条件覆盖"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A fulfillment report claims each condition stated on its exact request revision. This covers the supplied criterion inventory, not unrecorded or globally complete requirements."
msgstr "履行报告声称满足其确切请求修订所述的每个条件。这覆盖所给标准清单，而非未记录或全局完备的要求。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RequestFulfillment ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:FulfillmentConditionCoverageConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:RequestFulfillment ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fulfillment evaluation evidence"
msgstr "履行评估证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each claimed met condition has a retained ConditionEvaluation for this fulfillment with that evaluatedCondition, verdictHeld, an evaluator vantage and original source evidence. Validation does not execute the condition."
msgstr "每个声称满足的条件都具有为此履行保留的 ConditionEvaluation，带有相应 evaluatedCondition、verdictHeld、评估者视点及原始来源证据。验证不执行条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:meetsCondition ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:FulfillmentEvaluationEvidenceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:meetsCondition ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fulfillment evaluation scope"
msgstr "履行评估范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every retained evaluation binds this fulfillment's exact answered request revision and provided object, and evaluates a condition stated on that revision. All evaluation context bindings must agree; its observed feature remains the Condition."
msgstr "每个保留评估绑定此履行所回应的确切请求修订及所提供对象，并评估该修订所述的条件。评估的所有上下文绑定必须一致；其被观察特征仍为 Condition。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
msgstr "避免声称此定律执行提供方、核验来源字节或授予披露权限。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the exact source evidence when diagnosing a violated obligation; never invent missing inputs."
msgstr "诊断违反义务时保留确切来源证据；绝不虚构缺失输入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:fulfillmentEvaluation ."
msgstr "保留此支配定律：gmeow:FulfillmentEvaluationScopeConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:fulfillmentEvaluation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfilledTransitionEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "fulfilled transition evidence"
msgstr "已履行转换证据"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfilledTransitionEvidenceConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A transition explicitly reporting fulfilled retains a fulfillment report for the same request revision. Fulfillment is not inferred from acknowledgement, work status or acceptance wording."
msgstr "明确报告已履行的转换保留同一请求修订的履行报告。不从确认收到、工作状态或接受措辞推断履行。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfilledTransitionEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency within the declared source scope."
msgstr "用于检查声明来源范围内的内在一致性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/FulfilledTransitionEvidenceConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law executes a provider, verifies source bytes or grants disclosure permission."
